     The natural enemy population dynamics (dN/dt) follow a logistic growth pattern modified by
interactions with beneficial insects (γNB). The equation incorporates density-dependent mortality (δN) and
the effects of chemical controls (βNP), representing a sophisticated approach to biological control modeling
within the agricultural system.

